{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_376CD0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"……嗯……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"还能再听到你的声音，真好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"Kaz，下次给我准备个更锋利的家伙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"知道了。下次把线锯的锯片换成<R=金刚石,bort>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=金刚石,bort>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"呃……那么，那个“下次”是什么时候？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"抱歉……喂……你没事吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"嗯……。咳出来的气都是焦味。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"看来得暂时戒烟了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不，不用担心。胸口的疼痛已经消失了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"是模仿The Boss的伤口？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":29,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"对。连伤痕也消失了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"服了你了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"你那边情况怎么样？大家都没事吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"嗯……。其实有件事让我在意。我联系不上Paz。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"Paz……？她应该正受到“教授”的保护才对。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"是啊，本来应该如此……。听我说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"我有点担心，就派人去了“教授”安排的那所“学校”……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"然后……那所“学校”根本不存在？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不，“学校”确实存在，但Paz不在那里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"问过“学校”的相关人员后，他们说已经有一阵子没见过“教授”和Paz了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"……Coldman知道我们的事。CIA已经盯上了我们。连委托我们调查的KGB，还有Paz的事……他也知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":127,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"难道……落到Coldman手里了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"不。Gálvez可不只是个普通的“教授”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"是啊。KGB应该也一直掌握着Coldman的动向。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"这么说……他们可能察觉到了CIA的行动，躲到什么地方去了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"但愿如此。Kaz，也想办法从KGB那里弄些情报。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"知道了。我这边也会继续调查。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"Kaz，我们得赶快继续前进。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"Snake。至少从地面上看，还没有发现Peace Walker启动的迹象。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"它还在刚才那个机库里。这次真的是最后的机会了。去摧毁AI。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"了解。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}